#org @sText_TM01_Description
An attack that is\nexecuted last.\nThe user flinches\nif hit beforehand.

#org @sText_TM02_Description
Sharp, huge claws\nhook and slash the\nfoe quickly and\nwith great power.

#org @sText_TM03_Description
An attack with a\npulsing blast of\nwater. It may also\nconfuse the foe.

#org @sText_TM04_Description
The user focuses\nits mind to raise\nthe SP. ATK and\nSP. DEF stats.

#org @sText_TM05_Description
A sweet kiss that\nabsorbs half the\ndamage inflicted\nto restore HP.

#org @sText_TM06_Description
A move that badly\npoisons the foe.\nIts poison damage\nworsens every turn.

#org @sText_TM07_Description
A snowstorm lasting\nfive turns damages\nall POKéMON except\nthe ICE-type.

#org @sText_TM08_Description
The user bulks up\nits body to boost\nboth its ATTACK and\nDEFENSE stats.

#org @sText_TM09_Description
The user shoots\nseeds at the foe.\nTwo to five seeds\nare shot at once.

#org @sText_TM10_Description
An attack that\nvaries in type\ndepending on\nthe user.

#org @sText_TM11_Description
The sun blazes for\nfive turns, powering\nup FIRE-type\nmoves.

#org @sText_TM12_Description
The foe is taunted\ninto a rage that\nallows it to use\nonly attack moves.

#org @sText_TM13_Description
The foe is struck\nwith an icy beam.\nIt may leave the foe\nwith frostbite.

#org @sText_TM14_Description
Sharp pins are shot\nat the foe and hit\ntwo to five times\nat once.

#org @sText_TM15_Description
The foe is charmed\nby the user's cute\nappeals, sharply\ncutting its ATTACK.

#org @sText_TM16_Description
A wall of light\ncuts damage from\nSP. ATK attacks\nfor five turns.

#org @sText_TM17_Description
Enables the user to\nevade all attacks.\nIt may fail if used\nin succession.

#org @sText_TM18_Description
A heavy rain falls\nfor five turns,\npowering up WATER-\ntype moves.

#org @sText_TM19_Description
A harsh attack that\nabsorbs half the\ndamage it inflicted\nto restore HP.

#org @sText_TM20_Description
It protects the\nuser's party from\nall status problems\nfor five turns.

#org @sText_TM21_Description
A cutely executed\nattack that also\nsteals the foe's\nhold item.

#org @sText_TM22_Description
A 2-turn move that\nblasts the foe with\nabsorbed energy in\nthe 2nd turn.

#org @sText_TM23_Description
The user drops its\nfull body on the\nfoe. It may leave\nthe foe paralyzed.

#org @sText_TM24_Description
A strong electrical\nattack that may\nalso leave the foe\nparalyzed.

#org @sText_TM25_Description
The user shoots an\nodd psychic wave that\ninflicts physical\ndamage.

#org @sText_TM26_Description
An earthquake that\nstrikes all POK\eMON\nin battle excluding\nthe user.

#org @sText_TM27_Description
This attack move\ngrows more powerful\nthe more the user\nlikes its TRAINER.

#org @sText_TM28_Description
An attack that hits\non the 2nd turn.\nCan also be used\nto exit dungeons.

#org @sText_TM29_Description
A strong telekinetic\nattack. It may also\nlower the foe's\nSP. DEF stat.

#org @sText_TM30_Description
A shadowy blob is\nhurled at the foe.\nMay also lower the\nfoe's SP. DEF.

#org @sText_TM31_Description
An attack that also\nbreaks any barrier\nlike LIGHT SCREEN\nand REFLECT.

#org @sText_TM32_Description
Star-shaped rays\nthat never miss are\nfired at all foes\nin battle.

#org @sText_TM33_Description
A wall of light\ncuts damage from\nphysical attacks\nfor five turns.

#org @sText_TM34_Description
A rapid jolt of\nelectricity strikes\nthe foe. It can't\nbe evaded.

#org @sText_TM35_Description
The foe is scorched\nwith intense flames.\nThe foe may suffer\na burn.

#org @sText_TM36_Description
Filthy sludge is\nhurled at the foe.\nIt may poison the\ntarget.

#org @sText_TM37_Description
A 5-turn sandstorm\nthat damages all\ntypes except ROCK,\nGROUND, and STEEL.

#org @sText_TM38_Description
The user switches\nout, passing along\nany stat changes\nto the new battler.

#org @sText_TM39_Description
Boulders are hurled\nat the foe. It also\nlowers the foe's\nSPEED if it hits.

#org @sText_TM40_Description
An extremely fast\nattack against one\ntarget. It can't be\nevaded.

#org @sText_TM41_Description
The user thrashes\nabout for two to\nthree turns, then\nbecomes confused.

#org @sText_TM42_Description
An attack that is\nboosted if user is\nburned, poisoned,\nor paralyzed.

#org @sText_TM43_Description
The user cloaks\nitself with flame and\nattacks. It raises the\nuser's SPEED stat.

#org @sText_TM44_Description
The user sleeps for\ntwo turns to fully\nrestore HP and heal\nany status problem.

#org @sText_TM45_Description
An attack that varies\nin power and type\ndepending on the\nweather.

#org @sText_TM46_Description
An attack that may\ntake the foe's held\nitem if the user\nisn't holding one.

#org @sText_TM47_Description
The foe is hit with\nwings of steel.\nIt may also raise\nthe user's DEFENSE.

#org @sText_TM48_Description
The user attacks\nwith a song. Others\ncan join and make\nthe attack stronger.

#org @sText_TM49_Description
The user shoots\nboiling water at its\ntarget. It may also\nleave the foe burned.

#org @sText_TM50_Description
An intense attack\nthat also sharply\nreduces the user's\nSP. ATK stat.

#org @sText_TM51_Description
A self-healing move\nthat restores up to\nhalf of the user's\nmaximum HP.

#org @sText_TM52_Description
The user unleashes\nits power. Can lower\nfoe's SP.DEF.

#org @sText_TM53_Description
The foe is blasted\nwith natural energy.\nMay lower the foe's\nSP.DEF.

#org @sText_TM54_Description
A restrained attack\nthat always leaves\nthe foe with at\nleast 1 HP.

#org @sText_TM55_Description
The user cloaks\nitself in fire. It\nleaves the user with\nrecoil.

#org @sText_TM56_Description
The user flings its\nheld item at the foe.\nIts power and effects\ndepend on the item.

#org @sText_TM57_Description
The user fires a\nload of electricity\nthat raises the\nuser's SP.ATK. 

#org @sText_TM58_Description
The user attacks by\nhurling mud. It also\nreduces the foe's\nSPEED.

#org @sText_TM59_Description
The user focuses\nits willpower to its\nhead and attacks\nthe target.

#org @sText_TM60_Description
The user vibrates its\nwings to generate a\nsound wave. It may\nlower the SP. DEF.

#org @sText_TM61_Description
A sinister, bluish\nwhite flame is shot\nat the foe to\ninflict a burn.

#org @sText_TM62_Description
The user strikes\nthe target stronger\nif the user is not\nholding an item.

#org @sText_TM63_Description
A chilling wind is\nused to attack. It\nalso lowers the\nSPEED stat.

#org @sText_TM64_Description
The user explodes\nto inflict terrible\ndamage even while\nfainting itself.

#org @sText_TM65_Description
Claws made of\nshadows rake the\nfoe. It has a high\ncritical-hit ratio.

#org @sText_TM66_Description
If the user moves\nafter the target,\nthis attack's power\nwill be doubled.

#org @sText_TM67_Description
The user makes the\nground erupt with\npower. It may lower\nthe foe's SP. DEF.

#org @sText_TM68_Description
The user attacks with\nblades formed by\npsychic power. It has\na high crit ratio.

#org @sText_TM69_Description
The user polishes\nits body to sharply\nboost its SPEED.

#org @sText_TM70_Description
The user gathers all\nits light energy and\nreleases it at once.\nIt may lower SP. DEF.

#org @sText_TM71_Description
The user slams a\nbarrage of hard\nshelled seeds down\non the foe.

#org @sText_TM72_Description
After the attack,\nthe user rushes back\nto switch places with\na party POK\eMON.

#org @sText_TM73_Description
A weak electric\nshock that is sure\nto cause paralysis\nif it hits.

#org @sText_TM74_Description
The user drenches the\ntarget in a poisonous\nliquid. Doubles power\non a poisoned foe.

#org @sText_TM75_Description
A move that inflicts\ndouble the damage if\nthe user has been\nhurt in the same turn.

#org @sText_TM76_Description
Levitating rocks\nare laid around the\nfoe's party to hurt\nfoes switching in.

#org @sText_TM77_Description
This relentless move\ndoes massive damage\nto a target affected\nby status problems.

#org @sText_TM78_Description
The user plays rough\nwith the target. It\nmay lower the foe's\nATTACK.

#org @sText_TM79_Description
The user releases\na horrible aura that\nmay also make the\nfoe flinch.

#org @sText_TM80_Description
Large boulders are\nhurled at the foe.\nIt may make the\nfoe flinch.

#org @sText_TM81_Description
The user slams the\ntarget with its\nsteel-hard head. It\nmay flinch the foe.

#org @sText_TM82_Description
The user attacks the\ntarget's throat, and\nprevents from using\nsound moves.

#org @sText_TM83_Description
The user is roused,\nand its ATTACK and\nSP. ATK stats\nincrease.

#org @sText_TM84_Description
The foe is stabbed\nwith a limb steeped\nin poison. It may\nalso poison the foe.

#org @sText_TM85_Description
The user yells as if\nit's ranting, making\nthe target's SP.ATK\nstat decrease.

#org @sText_TM86_Description
The user vanishes\nsomewhere, then\nstrikes the target\non the next turn.

#org @sText_TM87_Description
A move that makes\nthe foe confused,\nbut also sharply\nraises its ATTACK.

#org @sText_TM88_Description
While asleep, the\nuser randomly uses\none of the moves\nit knows.

#org @sText_TM89_Description
After the attack,\nthe user rushes back\nto switch places with\na party POK\eMON.

#org @sText_TM90_Description
A trap of spikes\nis laid around the\nfoe's party to hurt\nfoes switching in.

#org @sText_TM91_Description
The user lays a trap\nof poison spikes.\nThey poison foes that\nswitch into battle.

#org @sText_TM92_Description
The user creates\na bizarre area in\nwhich slower POK\eMON\nget to move first.

#org @sText_TM93_Description
The user smashes\ninto its target. It\nalso damages the\nuser a little.

#org @sText_TM94_Description
An attack that\nabsorbs half the\ndamage it inflicted\nto restore HP.

#org @sText_TM95_Description
The user attacks with\na blade that slices\neven the sky. It may\nalso cause flinching.

#org @sText_TM96_Description
The user attacks 2 to\n5 times in a row. This\nboosts the user's\nSPEED but lowers DEF.

#org @sText_TM97_Description
It reduces the foe's\nevasion stat. It\nalso removes spikes,\nlight screens, etc.

#org @sText_TM98_Description
Knocks down the foe's\nheld item to prevent\nits use during\nthe battle.

#org @sText_TM99_Description
The user damages\nopposing POK\eMON by\nemitting a powerful\nflash.

#org @sText_TM100_Description
The user covers its\nfeet in thin ice and\ntwirls around. Also\ndestroys terrains.

#org @sText_TM101_Description
The user attacks with\na ray of light that\nsparkles as if it were\nmade of gemstones.

#org @sText_TM102_Description
The user shoots filthy\ngarbage at the foe\nto attack. It may\nalso poison the foe.

#org @sText_TM103_Description
Restores the user's\nHP. The amount of HP\nregained varies with\nthe weather.

#org @sText_TM104_Description
The user hardens its\nbody's surface to\nsharply raise its\nDEFENSE stat.

#org @sText_TM105_Description
The user electrifies\nthe ground under\neveryone's feet for\nfive turns.

#org @sText_TM106_Description
The user turns the\nground under\neveryone's feet to\ngrass for 5 turns.

#org @sText_TM107_Description
The user covers the\nground under\neveryone's feet with\nmist for five turns.

#org @sText_TM108_Description
This protects POK\eMON\non the ground from\npriority moves and\nboosts PSYCHIC moves.

#org @sText_TM109_Description
This move's type\nand power changes\ndepending on the\nterrain when used.

#org @sText_TM110_Description
The user fills a\nblade with the light's\nenergy, attacking the\nfoe on the next turn.

#org @sText_TM111_Description
The user attacks the\ntarget by showering\nit with water. This\nlowers the foe's ATK.

#org @sText_TM112_Description
User looses a blast\nof aura power from\ndeep within its body.\nBypasses accuracy.

#org @sText_TM113_Description
The user attacks by\nswinging its tail as\nif it were a vicious\nwave in a raging storm.

#org @sText_TM114_Description
The user fires a\nbeam of steel.\nThis also damages\nthe user.

#org @sText_TM115_Description
The foe is attacked\nwith a shock wave\ngenerated by the\nuser's gaping mouth.

#org @sText_TM116_Description
The foe is hit with\na flashing beam that\nmay also cause\nconfusion.

#org @sText_TM117_Description
The user lets loose\na horribly echoing\nshout with the power\nto inflict damage.

#org @sText_TM118_Description
User gathers space\npower and boosts its\nSP.ATK stat, then\nattacks the next turn.

#org @sText_TM119_Description
This move reduces\ndamage for five turns.\nOnly usable during\na snowstorm.

#org @sText_TM120_Description
After the attack,\nthe user rushes back\nto switch places with\na party POK\eMON.

#org @sText_HM01_Description
Cuts using claws,\nscythes, etc. Works\nsuper-effectively\nagainst GRASS types.

#org @sText_HM02_Description
A 2-turn move that\nhits on the 2nd turn.\nUse it to fly to\nany known town.

#org @sText_HM03_Description
A big wave crashes\ndown on the foe. Can\nalso be used for\ncrossing water.

#org @sText_HM04_Description
A powerful physical\nattack. Super-effective\non ROCK. Can be used\nto move boulders.

#org @sText_HM05_Description
Blinds the foe to\nreduce accuracy.\nIt's guaranteed\nto go first.

#org @sText_HM06_Description
A rock-crushing attack\nthat may lower DEFENSE.\nAlways crits against\nROCK types.

#org @sText_HM07_Description
A powerful charge\nattack. It can also\nbe used to climb\na waterfall.

#org @sText_HM08_Description
An attack that may\nleave the foe confused.\nCan be used to scale\nrocky walls.

